# Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# Debug symbols: the shipped DLL is enough, symbols would just bloat the repo
1.6/Assemblies/*.pdb

# Verification scratch data
Verify/out/
Verify/out-e2e/
Verify/tmp/

# Your own test-run output. Tracked checklist files (e.g. Verify/fixtures/*.md) are the
# source lists; the *.feedback.md files hold personal test results and are not part of the mod.
TestList/*.feedback.md

# Verify\e2e.ps1 writes a feedback file into the fixture folder and deletes it again;
# this keeps a crashed run from leaving one behind.
Verify/fixtures/*.feedback.md
